  "description": "Coral Cascade is built around a central tower, with climbing arms reaching out on each side. Children get up by the rock wall or the net climbers, hang from the frame and come back down through the tube slides. The age group starts at 5 years and key users are 5 to 12, so the climbs are pitched at school-age children rather than toddlers. It suits a primary school ground or a society whose children have outgrown smaller play units. Up to 15 children can use it at once. It comes in Play Orange and Royal Turquoise. The product area is 29'8\" x 26'1\" and the safe play area is 34'8\" x 32'1\". We give a 3-year warranty on galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope. Ask for a layout drawing for your ground.",
